    "user_title": "Build Persistent Azure AI Agents in Java",
    "value_statement": "Persistent agent workflows require coordinated clients, threads, messages, runs, and cleanup. This skill provides Java patterns for configuring and managing those Azure resources.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude",
